// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Boxes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2908313177" "Boxes"
// Description :
"P2160116552" "Seek clues to prototype's location"
// InteractBeginString :
"P620118964" "You begin searching the boxes."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1627539300" "You finish searching the boxes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P722265955" "This box has a disassembled automaton inside, along with a packing slip written in code."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P527583685" "You defeated the Nemesis squad leader and found a clue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3662911071" "This shipping note you found looks like it's in the same cipher that Lisa Colbert broke earlier. I guess the Nemesis army hasn't had time to update their codes. I'll get it deciphered. It seems pretty likely that this shipment came from the same warehouse that's housing Nemesis' new prototype."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis1_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P303067197" "I've had Lisa Colbert decrypt that packing slip you found at the Nemesis front company, Gordonless Imports. It pinpoints the warehouse that the Nemesis automatons are coming from. I really feel like we're closing in on that strange prototype we've been tracking. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you're ready, this is the time to raid the place.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3512081142" "Raid Gordonless Import warehouse"
// SendOffString :
"P972418128" "I'm really worried about this prototype, {HeroName}. The Nemesis armies already have such amazing technology! What's next?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2783157664" "Raid Gordonless warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P261551580" "We need to find that prototype!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3127065693" "This looks like a normal warehouse from the outside. But with Nemesis, looks can be very deceptive indeed."

