"P2987537124" "Personally, I despise those robot imposters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2140590564" "I shall not fail Lord Nemesis!"

