"P606339252" "You found a list of shipments."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2103074647" "This crate contains a disassembled Nemesis automaton."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1826278059" "You shut down the warehouse and found some strong leads."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3642748954" "You shut down Gordonless Imports hard, {HeroName}. I think your next stop should be this central information storehouse you learned of. Maybe there's something there that will lead us to the final destination of the prototype. I have to say, I really don't like the sound of this 'prototype mass-production robotic weapon.' Especially the 'mass-production' part."
// RandomFameString :
"P2266481547" "{HeroName} has been shutting down Nemesis business fronts left and right!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis1_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1186251201" "I've been able to pin down the location of the Nemesis records storehouse. This could be big, {HeroName}. There's a good chance that place contains information that can shut down a lot of nefarious Nemesis plots throughout the city. And it might just help us find that new weapon prototype they've developed. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are you ready to investigate that storehouse?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1292379510" "Investigate the Nemesis records storehouse"
// SendOffString :
"P324500222" "It's imperative that we find that weapon prototype as soon as possible. Anything you can learn will be a help."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P879496534" "I'm counting on you to find something that will lead us to that prototype weapon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1096534006" "The moment you enter, you can hear the distinctive hiss of Nemesis' steam technology."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

