"P2760237052" "I asked Lord Nemesis to place me in a Warhulk after my encounter with {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2185968396" "You cannot defeat me now. Vengeance shall be mine, {HeroName}!"

