// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3590688919" "I'll crack your skulls, you vigilantes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe1a 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2252294519" "Safe"
// InteractBeginString :
"P4257618816" "You begin opening the safe."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1302313110" "You have opened the safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3029702467" "You found some transfer orders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe2a 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1352811721" "You found some interesting records."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P76037405" "You found a clue to the prototype's location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P995179533" "You've just won a huge battle in the war against Nemesis, {HeroName}. These records you found should shut down a lot of the infiltration ops going on in the city. But I think what you've learned about that prototype may be even more important. <br><br>We knew it was a weapon, but I didn't think it would be a Nemesis battle suit! Nemesis often used duplicates of his own armor as heavy support troops for his soldiers. Though they were never as powerful as Nemesis himself, they were still one of the big terrors of his old army. The only reason he never fielded more of them was that they were too expensive to produce, even by his standards. If they've found a way to mass produce them, then there may be no stopping the Nemesis armies!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis1_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3342584844" "According to those transfer orders you found, the Nemesis armies plan to assemble their prototype Nemesis battle suit at a hidden lab. Lisa Colbert once again cracked the code, and it looks like it's off to the sewers for you! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get over to that lab and stop the soldiers from assembling that prototype!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P200685737" "Stop the soldiers from assembling the prototype"
// SendOffString :
"P686952285" "In days of old, the fake Nemeses did a great deal of damage. I hear it was often hard for heroes to tell the difference between the real Nemesis and his hollow constructs."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2167168417" "Defeat all soldiers in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4173018049" "You'll have to move quickly if you expect to stop those soldiers from assembling their Nemesis battle suit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2296441197" "This secret facility has been cleverly hidden in an offshoot of the sewer system."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2069461072" "Maintain a tight perimeter. {HeroName} will not interfere!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P1012041172" "I have {HeroName} targeted!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P1128442818" "Your time has come!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1193796539" "You found some blueprints."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3528387643" "You access the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P977785347" "You finish accessing the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P390586487" "You found a testing schedule."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1862185345" "You have defeated the Nemesis forces and found some important information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1779338321" "It looks like they've already assembled the battle suit, and they're getting ready to test it! If you can make certain those tests fail, {HeroName}, maybe they'll scrap the new battle suit as a failure. <br><br>You should know that heroes have already started rounding up the Nemesis automatons who have infiltrated the city. It seems there were hundreds in place already! If you hadn't found those records, I have no doubt that they would have done irrevocable harm to this town."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis1_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1422778724" "Nemesis forces are about to launch an attack against a Rikti enclave in order to test their new battle suit prototype. If you can destroy the prototype there, it should derail the whole project. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are you ready to take on one of Nemesis' legendary false Nemeses?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3275211640" "Take on the false Nemesis"
// SendOffString :
"P1371171918" "It may get pretty confused down there, but remember that your main goal is to find and destroy the prototype. That should shut this op down pretty quickly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2723447099" "Defeat prototype, its handlers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P379652711" "I think you'd be surprised by how much damage a Nemesis battle suit can do in a short time. You've got to take it down, fast!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2849358833" "This is it. You head now into a battle against not just Nemesis and the Rikti, but against the latest weapon in the Nemesis arsenal."

